.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
I am a wrapper class for the PyOpenSSL ``Context`` object\&. I am responsible
for translating the interface of the standard library ``SSLContext`` object
to calls into PyOpenSSL\&.

.fi
.PP
 
